1
00:05:32,727 --> 00:05:38,727
Prepare for the ride of your life.

2
00:11:05,454 --> 00:11:11,454
Extraction 2 is a action, thriller, crime film directed by Sam Hargrave.

3
00:16:38,181 --> 00:16:44,181
Back from the brink of death, highly skilled commando Tyler Rake takes on another
dangerous mission: saving the imprisoned family of a ruthless gangster.

4
00:22:10,909 --> 00:22:16,909
Tyler Rake, played by Chris Hemsworth.

5
00:27:43,636 --> 00:27:49,636
Nik Khan, played by Golshifteh Farahani.

6
00:33:16,363 --> 00:33:22,363
Yaz Khan, played by Adam Bessa.

7
00:38:49,090 --> 00:38:55,090
Zurab Radiani / Nikoloz Radiani, played by Tornike Gogrichiani.

8
00:44:21,818 --> 00:44:27,818
David Radiani, played by Tornike Bziava.

9
00:49:54,545 --> 00:50:00,545
Ketevan Radiani, played by Tinatin Dalakishvili.

10
00:55:27,272 --> 00:55:33,272
Extraction 2 is a 2023 American action thriller film directed by Sam Hargrave
and written by Joe Russo, based on the graphic novel Ciudad.

11
01:01:00,000 --> 01:01:06,000
It is the second installment in the Extraction franchise.

12
01:06:32,727 --> 01:06:38,727
Chris Hemsworth, Golshifteh Farahani and Adam Bessa reprise their roles from the first film, while Tornike Gogrichiani,
Tornike Bziava, Tinatin Dalakishvili, Daniel Bernhardt, Olga Kurylenko and Idris Elba appear in pivotal roles.

13
01:12:05,454 --> 01:12:11,454
In the film, Tyler Rake is initially hired to rescue the
family of a crime lord from a prison in Georgia.

14
01:17:38,181 --> 01:17:44,181
Following the successful debut of the first film, Netflix announced a sequel in May 2020 with Joe Russo
returning to write, Hargrave returning to direct and Hemsworth returning in the lead.

15
01:23:10,909 --> 01:23:16,909
By December, Joe and his brother Anthony hoped that the sequel would
develop the characters enough to start a cinematic universe.

16
01:28:43,636 --> 01:28:49,636
Filming was scheduled to begin in Sydney in September 2021, but was delayed by the COVID-19 pandemic
and eventually started in Prague in November, before concluding in Vienna in April 2022.

17
01:34:16,363 --> 01:34:22,363
In addition to the returns of the Russos, Hargrave and Hemsworth, Henry
Jackman and Alex Belcher returned to compose the score.

18
01:39:49,090 --> 01:39:55,090
Extraction 2 was released by Netflix on June 16,
2023 to positive reviews from critics.

19
01:45:21,818 --> 01:45:27,818
The film was nominated for Best Stunts (Action) at the 6th
Hollywood Critics Association Midseason Film Awards.

20
01:50:54,545 --> 01:51:00,545
The film explores themes of assassin, hero, escape, explosive, mercenary.

21
01:56:27,272 --> 01:56:33,272
The tone is dark and intense.
